# Allowlist (MIP-0008): the build context is what the Dockerfile targets need and nothing else —
# in particular never .env / *.pem / *.key (they are not listed, so they are not sent), never
# target/ (the builder compiles from source), never site/dist or data/ (derived, runtime).
*
!build.sbt
!project/build.properties
!project/plugins.sbt
!core
!local
!cli
!knowledge
# jvm/native no longer copy these (MIP-0070 §5.4); kept only for the `dev` target below
!site/areas.json
!site/static
# the `dev` target copies the working tree into the dev shell
!flake.nix
!flake.lock
!justfile
!scripts
!dspy
!finetune
!docs
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!LICENSE
!.githooks
!.scalafmt.conf
!.scalafix.conf
!ruff.toml
# never, even inside an allowed directory
**/target
**/.bloop
**/.bsp
**/.metals
**/__pycache__
finetune/out
finetune/data
docs/**/*.pdf
